WEBVTT

00:00:01.710 --> 00:00:05.010
This, is the Crimson Moon?

00:00:06.720 --> 00:00:09.150
At this rate <i>it</i> will resurrect.

00:00:09.150 --> 00:00:10.990
It?

00:00:10.990 --> 00:00:12.820
Rudra.

00:00:12.820 --> 00:00:17.930
Ancient Makai Knights and
Alchemists were unable to defeat it.

00:00:17.930 --> 00:00:20.730
A Horror with unimaginable power.

00:00:23.330 --> 00:00:27.170
What... What was I trying to do?!

00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:31.370
If you wish to know about the seal of the Crimson Moon,

00:00:31.370 --> 00:00:33.670
you must defeat me!

00:00:37.250 --> 00:00:39.080
A futile struggle.

00:00:42.250 --> 00:00:46.090
You know what lies there.

00:00:46.090 --> 00:00:50.290
It is impossible to control.
You will be devoured!

00:00:50.290 --> 00:00:53.860
Farewell, previous Ashiya Douman.

00:00:53.860 --> 00:00:55.630
Bastard!

00:00:59.230 --> 00:01:00.440
Finally.

00:01:00.440 --> 00:01:02.370
It has awakened.

00:01:06.410 --> 00:01:10.080
There is no longer any time.

00:01:10.080 --> 00:01:15.210
The catastrophe sealed with the Crimson Moon is Rudra.

00:01:16.450 --> 00:01:18.050
Rudra?

00:01:18.050 --> 00:01:21.260
It was a Horror so powerful the knights of old could not defeat it.

00:01:21.260 --> 00:01:27.660
Exceptionally skilled alchemists sealed it away with a moon barrier.

00:01:27.660 --> 00:01:33.570
The moon turning red is the first sign of its release.

00:01:33.570 --> 00:01:37.640
And now, it has found a suitable vessel.

00:01:37.640 --> 00:01:40.840
S-S-So the thing has resurrected?!

00:01:40.840 --> 00:01:44.910
No, it has not resurrected completely.

00:01:44.910 --> 00:01:51.090
Right now, it is gathering power within the vessel.

00:01:51.090 --> 00:01:56.620
And that vessel is probably in the hands of Douma Houshi.

00:01:56.620 --> 00:01:59.590
Douma Houshi? Why him?!

00:01:59.590 --> 00:02:03.800
He was the one who released the seal.

00:02:03.800 --> 00:02:08.670
This is a problem even more troublesome than I predicted.

00:02:08.670 --> 00:02:12.310
If Rudra appears, the capital will fall.

00:02:12.310 --> 00:02:14.640
Golden Knight Garo.

00:02:14.640 --> 00:02:16.040
Yes.

00:02:16.040 --> 00:02:21.650
We order you. Stop Douma Houshi's plans.

00:02:21.650 --> 00:02:25.450
And before Rudra's power is completely restored...

00:02:25.450 --> 00:02:28.000
Eliminate it.

00:02:48.340 --> 00:02:51.970
<i>The white lotus flower blooms</i>

00:02:53.350 --> 00:02:58.690
<i>The key to the bright night sky appears</i>

00:02:58.690 --> 00:03:04.330
<i>And now the hazy barrier fades away</i>

00:03:04.330 --> 00:03:09.460
<i>The unstoppable fate of time</i>

00:03:09.460 --> 00:03:14.030
<i>The ever repeating link</i>

00:03:14.670 --> 00:03:21.680
<i>Madder red clouds are swallowed up by darkness</i>

00:03:21.680 --> 00:03:26.920
<i>Swirling desire gives it strength</i>

00:03:26.920 --> 00:03:32.920
<i>A darkness that even provokes this love</i>

00:03:32.920 --> 00:03:34.920
<i>Quick as lightning</i>

00:03:34.920 --> 00:03:38.030
<i>Illusions, show your true form</i>

00:03:38.030 --> 00:03:43.230
<i>Sky, storm violently</i>

00:03:43.230 --> 00:03:48.870
<i>As the fang of steel shines with a golden gleam</i>

00:03:48.870 --> 00:03:58.870
<i>Why do people yearn for love so much</i> <i>their souls become dyed with crimson?</i>

00:03:59.380 --> 00:04:04.920
<i>Protect it to the end!</i>

00:04:04.920 --> 00:04:07.620
<i>Toward the light of the pure white lotus.</i>

00:04:07.620 --> 00:04:11.890
<i>AH... GARO</i>

00:04:11.090 --> 00:04:12.980
"GARO: CRIMSON MOON"

00:04:12.980 --> 00:04:17.980
"FRENZY"

00:04:19.130 --> 00:04:23.470
I have been appointed as head police magistrate by Michinaga-<i>sama.</i>

00:04:23.470 --> 00:04:26.270
Yorinobu-<i>sama</i>, a police magistrate?!

00:04:28.610 --> 00:04:33.110
First, I apologize for how the police magistrate has treated you.

00:04:33.110 --> 00:04:35.080
What are you saying after all you've done?!

00:04:35.080 --> 00:04:37.620
Stop! They'll cut you down!

00:04:37.620 --> 00:04:41.420
I know that trust is not easily rebuilt.

00:04:41.420 --> 00:04:45.690
However, without it, the capital cannot prosper.

00:04:45.690 --> 00:04:48.700
I want everyone to lend me your strength.

00:04:48.700 --> 00:04:50.500
Please.

00:04:50.500 --> 00:04:53.830
The police magistrates bowed their heads to us...

00:04:55.040 --> 00:04:57.370
Work together with us to change the capital!

00:05:24.830 --> 00:05:26.630
Wh-What was that?!

00:05:30.470 --> 00:05:31.910
Lightning?

00:05:41.850 --> 00:05:44.090
What is going on?

00:05:44.090 --> 00:05:45.850
Take the citizens to safety!

00:05:50.930 --> 00:05:52.860
Who is that?

00:05:52.860 --> 00:05:54.230
You will not escape!

00:05:55.900 --> 00:05:58.230
Wait! Who are you?!

00:06:10.880 --> 00:06:13.010
C-Could it be...?

00:06:13.010 --> 00:06:14.210
Are you...

00:06:16.380 --> 00:06:20.050
Where is the Golden Knight?

00:06:20.050 --> 00:06:22.080
Why...?

00:06:34.040 --> 00:06:39.370
He was saved by the immediate care given by the citizens.

00:06:39.370 --> 00:06:44.810
Yeah. If Yorinobu wasn't loved by the people, he would have already...

00:06:44.810 --> 00:06:46.550
According to the officers,

00:06:46.550 --> 00:06:52.420
he gave chase to someone moments after the red lightning fell.

00:06:52.420 --> 00:06:56.290
I never expected things to escalate so quickly.

00:06:56.290 --> 00:06:58.120
Brother...

00:06:58.390 --> 00:06:59.760
Yorinobu-<i>sama</i>!

00:06:59.760 --> 00:07:01.000
Yorinobu!

00:07:01.000 --> 00:07:04.660
Ugh... S-Sei...

00:07:06.900 --> 00:07:08.100
Yorinobu!

00:07:10.770 --> 00:07:13.510
I understand the situation.

00:07:13.510 --> 00:07:16.140
There weren't any serious problems?

00:07:16.140 --> 00:07:18.750
No, the Light Palace remained undamaged.

00:07:18.750 --> 00:07:22.960
Lightning of that level cannot pierce the powerful barrier here.

00:07:22.960 --> 00:07:25.150
I'll leave it to you.

00:07:25.150 --> 00:07:26.450
Where are you headed?

00:07:26.450 --> 00:07:28.190
It matters not to you.

00:07:28.190 --> 00:07:30.630
Come, Haruaki.

00:07:30.630 --> 00:07:31.820
Yes.

00:08:09.730 --> 00:08:15.700
I consider this world to be my own.

00:08:15.700 --> 00:08:19.470
Like the full moon, I lack nothing.

00:08:39.760 --> 00:08:41.790
Just now...

00:08:43.330 --> 00:08:48.670
So, putting Douman aside, who the hell is Douma Houshi?

00:08:48.670 --> 00:08:52.940
Douma Houshi, the previous Ashiya Douman.

00:08:52.940 --> 00:08:54.740
That's all I know.

00:08:54.740 --> 00:08:56.280
Previous, huh?

00:08:56.280 --> 00:09:00.410
So Douma Houshi is involved with both the Horror called Rudra

00:09:00.410 --> 00:09:03.720
and the attack on Yorinobu?

00:09:03.720 --> 00:09:06.790
I don't have concrete proof, but I believe that to be the case.

00:09:06.790 --> 00:09:08.360
Then, this'll be easy.

00:09:08.360 --> 00:09:09.690
Huh?

00:09:09.690 --> 00:09:12.930
He's been causing a lot of problems, one right after another.

00:09:12.930 --> 00:09:15.760
He will show himself soon.

00:09:15.760 --> 00:09:17.600
Why do you think that?

00:09:17.600 --> 00:09:19.630
That's what my gut tells me.

00:09:19.630 --> 00:09:23.240
You have a keen nose for villains.

00:09:23.240 --> 00:09:25.570
He's an ex-police magistrate, after all!

00:09:25.570 --> 00:09:28.080
Don't say unnecessary things.

00:09:28.080 --> 00:09:33.210
The vessel may be Douma Houshi himself.

00:09:33.210 --> 00:09:37.920
I would keep something
I valued where I could see it.

00:09:37.920 --> 00:09:40.590
Your gut as a thief, this time?

00:09:40.590 --> 00:09:46.730
There's no way to know for sure until we meet him face to face.

00:09:46.730 --> 00:09:48.000
You're right.

00:09:48.000 --> 00:09:50.600
We only know one thing, right now.

00:09:50.600 --> 00:09:54.630
If we don't stop them, the capital will fall.

00:10:04.650 --> 00:10:05.810
Damn.

00:10:05.810 --> 00:10:08.510
I really feel like I'm part of the police magistrate again.

00:10:14.990 --> 00:10:17.930
This boring game is over, Ashiya Douman.

00:10:21.960 --> 00:10:25.470
But things are just about to get exciting.

00:10:25.470 --> 00:10:28.470
You know what I want to know, don't you?

00:10:28.470 --> 00:10:32.110
Force it out of me if you want to know.

00:10:32.110 --> 00:10:33.800
I'll do just that.

00:10:54.360 --> 00:10:56.560
No openings this way.

00:10:57.670 --> 00:10:59.570
Let's get a bit serious!

00:11:11.310 --> 00:11:12.680
What?!

00:11:19.690 --> 00:11:23.820
It seems the vessel hates
Makai Knights very much.

00:11:23.820 --> 00:11:25.220
Shit!

00:11:45.180 --> 00:11:47.280
Be careful, Kintoki.

00:11:47.280 --> 00:11:48.580
Yes!

00:12:02.430 --> 00:12:04.230
Yasusuke!

00:12:07.030 --> 00:12:10.070
You, the Golden Knight.

00:12:10.070 --> 00:12:13.210
What were you doing?! Pathetic.

00:12:13.210 --> 00:12:16.640
We will treat Hakamadare here.

00:12:16.640 --> 00:12:20.720
He mumbled feverishly.

00:12:20.720 --> 00:12:25.150
That you will definitely lose if you falter.

00:12:33.460 --> 00:12:38.600
Kintoki, I know I shouldn't show weakness.

00:12:38.600 --> 00:12:43.000
But, if she were here beside me...

00:12:43.000 --> 00:12:47.170
The Golden Knight should not talk like that!

00:12:47.170 --> 00:12:51.250
However, I feel the same way.

00:12:51.250 --> 00:12:53.480
She's normally a troublesome one,

00:12:53.480 --> 00:12:56.940
but you could depend on her during times like this.

00:13:01.760 --> 00:13:06.030
Raiko-<i>sama</i>, why not ask for help?

00:13:06.030 --> 00:13:07.220
Huh?

00:13:08.800 --> 00:13:11.870
So, you came to me.

00:13:11.870 --> 00:13:16.300
Even now, Seimei must be somewhere, fighting alone.

00:13:16.300 --> 00:13:22.480
Kiyome is probably already...

00:13:22.480 --> 00:13:28.050
The power of the
Golden Knight is necessary, after all.

00:13:28.050 --> 00:13:33.050
I understand. I will try to find Kiyome.

00:13:33.050 --> 00:13:35.120
Is something like that possible?

00:13:36.390 --> 00:13:40.230
It will take some time to prepare, please wait.

00:14:08.990 --> 00:14:11.320
I am...

00:14:14.860 --> 00:14:20.200
The pulse I am about the release will only respond to members of the Abe family.

00:14:20.200 --> 00:14:24.540
If it reaches Kiyome, it will surely respond back to us.

00:14:24.540 --> 00:14:26.410
Please.

00:14:26.410 --> 00:14:28.930
Then, I will begin.

00:14:52.370 --> 00:14:54.530
Look, Raiko-<i>sama</i>!

00:14:55.640 --> 00:14:57.070
Let's hurry and follow!

00:14:57.070 --> 00:14:59.710
Thank you very much, Haruaki-<i>sama</i>!

00:15:01.610 --> 00:15:03.440
Take care of Kiyome!

00:15:05.750 --> 00:15:10.150
What cruel fate!

00:15:11.550 --> 00:15:12.880
Seimei.

00:15:18.490 --> 00:15:21.260
B-Brother...

00:15:22.060 --> 00:15:27.030
Do not worry. Raiko-<i>sama</i> is strong.

00:15:28.400 --> 00:15:33.570
Do not fight her...

00:15:41.980 --> 00:15:43.920
She must be around here!

00:15:43.920 --> 00:15:46.790
Seimei! Seimei!

00:15:46.790 --> 00:15:49.150
Who are you looking for?

00:15:51.190 --> 00:15:52.660
Douman!

00:15:52.660 --> 00:15:54.190
Bastard, how dare you!

00:15:54.190 --> 00:16:00.800
Even though you can don the armor alone, you still call for Seimei.

00:16:00.800 --> 00:16:02.190
Shut up!

00:16:02.190 --> 00:16:04.670
Hurry up and get down here, you bastard!

00:16:04.670 --> 00:16:09.010
You've got no chance if Raiko-<i>sama</i> and Seimei fight against you!

00:16:09.010 --> 00:16:10.810
Don't howl so loudly.

00:16:10.810 --> 00:16:13.780
We went through the trouble of waiting for you.

00:16:13.780 --> 00:16:15.680
Why are you here?

00:16:15.680 --> 00:16:19.290
Well, you'll find out soon enough.

00:16:19.290 --> 00:16:22.990
There are others who are searching for you.

00:16:22.990 --> 00:16:24.960
Douma Houshi.

00:16:30.360 --> 00:16:34.230
I've already killed
Douma Houshi with my own hands.

00:16:34.230 --> 00:16:37.340
He was just a senile old man.

00:16:37.340 --> 00:16:41.840
I alone am the true Ashiya Douman!

00:16:41.840 --> 00:16:44.080
You killed him? Then...

00:16:44.080 --> 00:16:46.810
So you are the current Golden Knight?

00:17:04.730 --> 00:17:07.770
Seimei...

00:17:07.770 --> 00:17:10.170
I wanted to meet you.

00:17:10.170 --> 00:17:13.710
Jeez, she made us worry so much!

00:17:13.710 --> 00:17:16.340
No, this woman!

00:17:16.340 --> 00:17:17.780
Watch out!

00:17:21.420 --> 00:17:22.540
Kintoki!

00:17:23.550 --> 00:17:25.620
A tough boy.

00:17:25.620 --> 00:17:27.180
What's the meaning of this?!

00:17:29.890 --> 00:17:32.260
Why are you doing this?!

00:17:32.260 --> 00:17:35.400
Arch enemies meet and fight to the death...

00:17:35.400 --> 00:17:37.390
What is so strange?

00:17:43.040 --> 00:17:44.470
Stop it!

00:17:51.750 --> 00:17:53.810
Why don't you fight me?

00:17:53.810 --> 00:17:56.050
Why must I fight you?

00:17:56.050 --> 00:17:58.710
It's hard to believe you are a Makai Knight.

00:18:10.930 --> 00:18:12.570
Kintoki!

00:18:12.570 --> 00:18:17.000
I also do not understand what is going on right now.

00:18:17.000 --> 00:18:18.110
However...

00:18:18.110 --> 00:18:22.740
If you cut Seimei down, no matter what the reason,

00:18:22.740 --> 00:18:25.980
I am sure you will no longer be the same.

00:18:25.980 --> 00:18:27.280
But!

00:18:27.280 --> 00:18:32.190
You are a Makai Knight.
You will continue to protect the people.

00:18:32.190 --> 00:18:37.320
And it is my duty to protect you.

00:18:37.320 --> 00:18:39.790
I am your one and only attendant, after all!

00:18:41.630 --> 00:18:43.010
Kintoki.

00:18:51.000 --> 00:18:52.310
Kintoki!

00:18:52.310 --> 00:18:55.830
Distasteful. Do not interfere.

00:18:57.710 --> 00:19:03.320
If I fall that easily, I won't be able to protect Raiko-<i>sama.</i>

00:19:03.320 --> 00:19:04.440
That's enough!

00:19:14.500 --> 00:19:16.490
Did he die this time?

00:19:21.900 --> 00:19:24.740
Seimei!

00:19:28.810 --> 00:19:30.070
Raiko-<i>sama.</i>

00:19:42.690 --> 00:19:44.060
Here she comes!

00:19:51.400 --> 00:19:53.700
Front or back?

00:19:53.700 --> 00:19:54.900
Above!

00:20:19.590 --> 00:20:21.260
Put on your armor, Raiko!

00:20:21.260 --> 00:20:22.420
You'll die!

00:20:29.740 --> 00:20:32.310
Such a disgusting sight.

00:20:32.310 --> 00:20:34.370
This is the end, Golden Knight!

00:20:39.110 --> 00:20:40.380
Who is it?

00:20:58.100 --> 00:20:59.300
Kaguya?!

00:20:59.300 --> 00:21:01.270
You...!

00:21:11.140 --> 00:21:12.610
This is...!

00:21:19.120 --> 00:21:22.150
She was the one who sealed me...

00:21:23.860 --> 00:21:27.090
I never thought she would appear here!

00:21:27.090 --> 00:21:28.960
It seems we are done for the night.

00:21:28.960 --> 00:21:32.770
Golden Knight!
I will definitely kill you next time!

00:21:32.770 --> 00:21:34.130
Wait!

00:21:39.140 --> 00:21:40.470
Seimei...

00:21:41.540 --> 00:21:44.480
That painful cry from the soul.

00:21:44.480 --> 00:21:46.660
So it was you, Raiko-<i>sama.</i>

00:21:48.680 --> 00:21:52.790
Kaguya, why are you here?

00:21:52.790 --> 00:21:54.620
I remember now.

00:21:57.390 --> 00:22:05.070
I am the one who seals Horrors away within the red moon.

00:22:05.070 --> 00:22:06.290
Huh?

00:22:53.250 --> 00:23:01.190
<i>Whilst looking at the filling moon</i>

00:23:01.190 --> 00:23:11.280
<i>Today, as well, I bury these growing feelings</i>

00:23:11.280 --> 00:23:18.310
<i>The skies of fate have split in two</i>

00:23:18.310 --> 00:23:24.300
<i>(Shine upon the darkness) Lead me</i>

00:23:25.780 --> 00:23:30.650
<i>Yearning for the light, I throw out my heart</i>

00:23:30.650 --> 00:23:35.790
<i>I will always be beside you</i>

00:23:35.790 --> 00:23:42.430
<i>So until the last moment of this life</i>

00:23:42.430 --> 00:23:47.630
<i>Let me see this fleeting dream</i>

00:23:50.990 --> 00:24:01.000
"Next Episode: VESSEL"

00:23:52.150 --> 00:23:53.950
One of darkness.

00:23:53.950 --> 00:23:56.350
One of pure white.

00:23:56.350 --> 00:24:00.260
To the ends of untainted truth.
